    "body": "## Problem:\r\n`winblend` still take effect when setting background. This behavior differs from most of terminals. So, some CLI tools may exhibit strange behavior(e.g. some theme of shell which is show below).\r\n\r\n## Solution:\r\nSet `blend` to `0` when `bg_default` is false.\r\n\r\n## Snapshot:\r\nSome screenshots I've collected from different Terminal(Pay attention to the colored blocks):\r\n+ nvim(unfixd):\r\n  <img width=\"1177\" height=\"637\" alt=\"nvim(unfixed)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46065892-cca4-4231-8299-b0813454581c\" />\r\n+ nvim(fixed):\r\n  <img width=\"1164\" height=\"630\" alt=\"nvim(fixed)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b804eb59-1100-4b08-a535-8f7f2f014acf\" />\r\n+ windows terminal:\r\n  <img width=\"890\" height=\"513\" alt=\"win-terminal\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6971785-b311-4f4b-98e5-db875dc3be9c\" />\r\n+ Konsole(from Internet):\r\n  <img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Konsole\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22bf219e-8073-4af2-b982-dee7e5cc99dc\" />\r\n+ Alacritty(from Internet):\r\n  <img width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"Alacritty \" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab2c0c7e-cf2a-4f1f-b36c-e269be834fb1\" />\r\n+ Gnome(from Internet):\r\n  <img width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"Gnome\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b34afd1c-c3bc-4d71-8b97-727e387b72f7\" />",
